{
  "abstract": "A self-contained version of the formal-conjectures formalization by Paul Lezeau and Dean Cureton. It disproves the generalized Jacobian conjecture over every nontrivial commutative ring using an explicit determinant-one polynomial self-map in three variables. The formal-conjectures formalisation remains the reference statement.",
